===Pronunciation===
{{rfp|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{botany}} Any plant belonging to the ''[[Monocotyledones]]'' (also written ''Monocotyledonae)'' or ''[[Liliopsida]]'', a class in the ''Angiospermae'', the [[flowering plant]]s. This group include the [[grass]]es, [[lilies]], [[orchid]]s and [[palm]]s.

====Usage notes====
* Outside definitions or strict taxonomic usage, {{term|monocot}}is the preferred form.

====Synonyms====
* [[monocot]]
* [[liliopsid]]

